00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:52.510
that we're bringing into
Android, which as enterprises

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:55.760
you can benefit from.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:59.300
So let's first talk
about the devices.

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:04.220
And I already touched on
just diversity of use cases,

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:06.400
but here you can see
that more explicitly.

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.560
So all the way from
the traditional use

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:11.800
cases of smartphones
and tablets through

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:14.940
dedicated devices that
a logistics worker might

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:19.540
use when delivering a package
