00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:30.950
at the end of their
shift, and making sure

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:34.520
that we can deal with the
different logins scenarios,

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:37.646
deleting data from the
devices when a user logs out

00:05:37.646 --> 00:05:39.020
to make sure you've
got that sort

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:44.210
