00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:48.740
Kiosk devices, embedded points
of sale, digital displays,

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:55.340
they're all kind of more of
the dedicated fixed cases.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:56.960
Virtual reality is
something that's

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.880
a bit of a buzzword
